WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two targets appear close together. Observers can miss the second.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Months of intensive meditation changed performance in a laboratory study.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
That research did not test a twelve-minute commercial audio track.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Zen12 describes short sessions and different listening styles.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Brainwave entrainment studies disagree; the review never tested Zen12.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Understand the format. Check the evidence. Decide without pressure.
